d MYC-WRN refinements did not confirm robust clinically meaningful effects; and many constructed research-marker interactions are null. Remaining uncertainty is concentrated in whether accepted effects are modified by co-genomic context, because main effects can be large while interaction strata are imprecise: H72 is small and wide, H119 and H139 are wide, and H116/H125 remain borderline or unconfirmed. The most informative next analysis is to spend validation budget on still-unvalidated core accepted claims, beginning with H8 MSI-high versus stronger dependency_WRN, then H6 SMARCA4 loss versus stronger dependency_SMARCA2 and H17 KEAP1 loss versus weaker dependency_NFE2L2. These validation tests are more decision-relevant than further broad mutation scans. I therefore defer H133 and register a focused MTAP interaction refinement of the CDKN2A-MDM2 axis because MTAP co-deletion is biologically adjacent to CDKN2A and may clarify whether the accepted MDM2 locus effect is CDKN2A-specific or locus co-deletion-associated.",
