erline; constructed marker main effects and STK11 main effects incomplete.\n\nActive for next analyze: H263 EMT-low PTEN/STAT3; H270 MTAP-loss CDKN2A/MDM2; H279 MTAP-wt CDKN2A/MDM2; H280 STK11-intact KEAP1/NFE2L2; H271 KEAP1 x STK11 interaction; H281 low-TMB MSI/WRN; H272 MSI x high-TMB interaction; H233-H236 STK11 direct main effects. Prioritize MTAP, STK11, TMB, EMT over STK11 main effects if selection is constrained."
